{block title}Loop editor{/block}

{block content}
<h2 style="margin-bottom:4px; font-size:18px;">Loop editor</h2>
<div style="color:var(--text2); font-size:13px; margin-bottom:20px;">
	Every agent's <strong>harness</strong> — the definition, the system prompt, the tool
	roster, the measured write grants, the gate set it is judged by. Read-only, and it
	stays read-only: an editor that writes the harness is the <code>harness</code> proposal
	kind wearing a browser. This page exists so consent is possible before a switch is
	thrown, not to throw one.
</div>

{if $repoRoot === ''}
	<div class="badge badge-warning" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
		NOS_REPO_ROOT is unset — the harness is UNREADABLE from here. That is not the same
		fact as "no agents"; nothing below could be read.
	</div>
{/if}

{* ── the toggle ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── *}
<h3 style="font-size:15px; margin-bottom:10px;">Harness enhancement</h3>
<table style="margin-bottom:8px;">
	<thead><tr><th>Toggle</th><th>State</th><th>Address</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="font-size:12px;">{$toggle['row']['name'] ?? 'harness_proposals_enabled'}</td>
			<td>
				{if !$toggle['found']}
					<span class="badge badge-warning">UNKNOWN — row not found</span>
				{elseif $toggle['enabled']}
					<span class="badge badge-critical">ON</span>
				{else}
					<span class="badge">OFF</span>
				{/if}
			</td>
			<td style="font-size:11px; color:var(--text2)">{$toggleAddress}</td>
			<td style="font-size:11px; color:var(--text2)">{$toggle['path']}</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
<div style="color:var(--text2); font-size:12px; margin-bottom:24px;">
	{if $toggle['found']}{$toggle['row']['description'] ?? ''}{/if}
	The committed fixture is the value; there is no control here because the loop may not
	propose a change to it and neither may a browser session — the toggle's paths are on
	the denylist floor (docs/idea/11-agentic-loop-contract.md §5.2). A permission a system can grant itself is not a permission.
</div>

{* ── Q6 seam (3): the intent classes, disabled ones marked ───────────────── *}
<h3 style="font-size:15px; margin-bottom:10px;">Proposal intent classes</h3>
{if count($intents['classes']) === 0}
	<div class="badge badge-warning" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
		UNKNOWN — could not read the enum from {$intents['source']}. Not "no intent classes".
	</div>
{else}
	<table style="margin-bottom:8px;">
		<thead><tr><th>Intent</th><th>Accepted?</th></tr></thead>
		<tbody>
			{foreach $intents['classes'] as $i}
				<tr>
					<td style="font-size:12px;"><code>{$i['name']}</code></td>
					<td style="font-size:11px;">
						{if $i['disabled']}
							<span class="badge badge-warning">refused</span>
							{if $intents['toggleNote']}<span style="color:var(--text2)"> — governed by {$intents['toggleNote']}</span>{/if}
						{else}
							accepted
						{/if}
					</td>
				</tr>
			{/foreach}
		</tbody>
	</table>
	<div style="color:var(--text2); font-size:11px; margin-bottom:24px;">
		Read from {$intents['source']} at render time, not restated here — a second copy of a
		closed enum is the copy that drifts.
	</div>
{/if}

{* ── the harnesses ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── *}
<h3 style="font-size:15px; margin-bottom:10px;">Harnesses ({count($harnesses)})</h3>
{if count($harnesses) === 0}
	<div style="color:var(--text2); font-size:13px;">
		No agent definition was readable{if $repoRoot === ''} — see the unset repo root above{/if}.
	</div>
{else}
	{foreach $harnesses as $h}
		<details style="margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid var(--border, #333); padding:10px;">
			<summary style="cursor:pointer; font-size:14px;">
				<strong>{$h['name']}</strong>
				<span style="color:var(--text2); font-size:11px;">
					gateset {$h['gateset'] ?? '—'}
					· {count($h['tools'])} tool{if count($h['tools']) !== 1}s{/if}
					· {count($h['capabilities'])} capabilit{if count($h['capabilities']) !== 1}ies{else}y{/if}
					{if $h['runnerStatus']} · runner {$h['runnerStatus']}{/if}
				</span>
			</summary>

			<div style="font-size:12px; margin:10px 0;">
				<strong>Tools:</strong>
				{if count($h['tools']) === 0}<span style="color:var(--text2)">none declared</span>
				{else}{implode(', ', $h['tools'])}{/if}
			</div>
			<div style="font-size:12px; margin:10px 0;">
				<strong>Capabilities:</strong>
				{if count($h['capabilities']) === 0}<span style="color:var(--text2)">none declared</span>
				{else}{implode(', ', $h['capabilities'])}{/if}
			</div>
			<div style="font-size:12px; margin:10px 0;">
				<strong>Measured write grants:</strong>
				{if $h['grants'] === null}
					<span class="badge badge-warning">UNKNOWN — grants artifact unreadable</span>
				{elseif count($h['grants']) === 0}
					<span style="color:var(--text2)">none — no write this agent made was grandfathered</span>
				{else}
					{implode(', ', $h['grants'])}
				{/if}
			</div>

			<div style="font-size:12px; margin-top:12px;">
				<strong>agent.yml</strong>
				{if !$h['agentYmlParsed']}<span class="badge badge-warning">did not parse</span>{/if}
			</div>
			<pre style="max-height:340px; overflow:auto; font-size:11px;">{$h['agentYml']}</pre>

			<div style="font-size:12px; margin-top:12px;"><strong>{$h['systemPromptPath']}</strong></div>
			{if $h['systemPrompt'] === null}
				<div class="badge badge-warning">absent — the agent runs with no system prompt on disk</div>
			{else}
				<pre style="max-height:340px; overflow:auto; font-size:11px;">{$h['systemPrompt']}</pre>
			{/if}
		</details>
	{/foreach}
{/if}
{/block}
